NutsBot is a discord bot.

Required environment, dependencies and packages:
Linux Distribution with SystemD
python 3
discordpy


Config file explained:

{
	"token_file_path": "/path/to/your/token/file",
	"run_dir_path": "/path/to/your/nutsbot_run_directory"
	"sqlite3_db_path": "/path/to/your/sqlite_database_file.db"
	"sqlite3_no_db_path": "true"
}

token_file_path
This is the path to a FILE where you put the bot's token.

run_dir_path
The path to a DIRECTORY, the working directory of the bot, where the bot script is stored and where other data for the bot is stored.

sqlite3_db_path
Path to the database FILE.

sqlite3_no_db_path
If you set this to 'true' then the 'sqlite3_db_path' will be ignored. The database file will be created inside the working directory of the bot specified by 'run_dir_path'